Subject: [PATCH 06960/11362] [conductor] Checkpoint: preserve uncommitted work
 from interrupted run

Co-Authored-By: Codex CLI <noreply@openai.com>
---
 ops/conductor-heartbeat.json  |  2 +-
 ops/conductor-log.md          |  1 +
 ops/conductor-state.json      |  2 +-
 scripts/research_conductor.py | 23 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 25 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

